---
layout: base.njk
title: Contact
description: Story ideas, corrections, and general questions for Long Course.
permalink: /contact/
---
<article class="page wrap-narrow">
  <header class="page-head">
    <p class="kicker">Contact</p>
    <h1 class="page-title">Write to Long Course</h1>
    <p class="dek">Story ideas, corrections, collaboration, or a question about something we published.</p>
  </header>
  <div class="article-body">
    <div class="notice">
      <p><strong>A note before you write.</strong> Long Course is written for a wide audience, so we do not advise on individual situations and we ask you not to send personal medical details. For symptoms, medications, or eating disorder care, your own clinician or dietitian is the right person, and they will have far more context than we ever could.</p>
    </div>
    <form class="contact-form" name="contact" method="POST" action="/thanks/" data-netlify="true" netlify-honeypot="company">
      <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="contact">
      <p class="visually-hidden"><label>Leave this empty: <input name="company" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"></label></p>
      <div class="field">
        <label for="c-name">Your name</label>
        <input id="c-name" name="name" type="text" required autocomplete="name">
      </div>
      <div class="field">
        <label for="c-email">Email, so we can reply</label>
        <input id="c-email" name="email" type="email" required autocomplete="email">
      </div>
      <div class="field">
        <label for="c-topic">What is this about?</label>
        <select id="c-topic" name="topic" required>
          <option value="question">A question about an article</option>
          <option value="idea">A story idea or reader question</option>
          <option value="correction">A correction</option>
          <option value="collaboration">Collaboration, interview, or partnership</option>
          <option value="newsletter">Newsletter help</option>
          <option value="other">Something else</option>
        </select>
      </div>
      <div class="field">
        <label for="c-message">Message</label>
        <textarea id="c-message" name="message" rows="7" required></textarea>
      </div>
      <p class="signup-fine">You will get an automatic confirmation from the publication's assistant. Routine questions get a reply that points to relevant articles. Anything that needs Yiğit personally is passed to him. <a href="/privacy/">Privacy</a>.</p>
      <button type="submit">Send</button>
    </form>
    <p>Prefer email? Write to <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>.</p>
  </div>
</article>
